{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17160","headline":"奉和圣制中和节赐百官宴集因示後怀 · 权德舆","name":"奉和圣制中和节赐百官宴集因示後怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万方庆嘉节，宴喜皇泽均。\n晓开蓂叶初，景丽星鸟春。\n藻思贞百度，着明并三辰。\n物情舒在阳，时令弘至仁。\n衢酒和乐被，薰弦声曲新。\n赓歌武弁侧，永荷玄化醇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17160.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17160","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}